        "original_id": "fcc4a1fe-70a4-540f-9591-28a4b73622e3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Anaïs Lameche, Darren Hayes, Anna Sundstrand, Faye Hamlin, Rosie Munter\n- Groups: Play\n- Works: Playin' Around, Replay\n- Topics: pop music, concert performance, studio recording\n\nFacts:\n- Darren Hayes was born on 8 May 1972 and is an Australian singer-songwriter, comedian, and podcaster.\n- Anaïs Helena Lameche Bonnier, née Kretz Lameche, was born on 19 August 1987 in the French Alps, France.\n- Anaïs Lameche is a former Swedish pop singer and an original member of the Swedish pop group Play.\n- Playin' Around, also known as Playin' Around the World, contains about an hour of video segments featuring Play members Anaïs Lameche, Anna Sundstrand, Faye Hamlin, and Rosie Munter.\n- In Playin' Around, the members of Play perform songs in concert, rehearse music videos, discuss life on their tour bus, and record tracks in the studio for the album Replay.",
